NVIDIA License in LICENSE (non-commercial: research or evaluation only), the license of the model it ports.

Derived files
-------------
nemotron_image_mlx/vq.py
  MLX re-implementation of NVIDIA's L24SQ image tokenizer (modeling_l24sq_vit.py,
  Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES, NVIDIA License).

nemotron_image_mlx/model.py, nemotron_image_mlx/prompt.py
  MLX re-implementation of NemotronH and of the Unitron lazy-vision tokenizer behaviour, following
  modeling_nemotron_h.py (Copyright 2024 HuggingFace Inc. team; Copyright (c) 2025 NVIDIA CORPORATION; Apache-2.0)
  and tokenization_unitron_lazy_vision.py (Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION; Apache-2.0), and the numerics of
  vLLM (Apache-2.0). The Apache License, Version 2.0 applies to the portions derived from those files.

scripts/shims/nemotron_ref/
  Copies of modeling_nemotron_h.py and configuration_nemotron_h.py (Apache-2.0, notices retained) with the CUDA
  stream context made a no-op, used only as a CPU reference in validation.

scripts/shims/mamba_ssm/ops/triton/layernorm_gated.py
  The reference function rms_norm_ref from mamba_ssm (Apache-2.0, Tri Dao and Albert Gu).

Model weights are not included; they are distributed separately on Hugging Face under the NVIDIA License.
